                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">为推进“不忘初心、牢记使命”主题教育在全体党员中间往深里走，往心里走，往实里走，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>10</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>21</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">日，我校各党支部借助主题党日活动的契机，采取分散组织与集中开展相结合的形式，扎扎实实地开展了主题为“学习时代楷模，践行初心使命”的主题教育学习活动。本次主题教育活动主要分为三个部分：学习时代楷模黄文秀、支部书记上党课、主题教育应知应会测试。校党委班子成员均以普通党员身份分别到各联系支部参加了活动。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt">致敬时代楷模</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt"><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt">汲取精神力量</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 15.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体"><FONT size=3>“黄文秀同志研究生毕业后，放弃大城市的工作机会，毅然回到家乡，在脱贫攻坚第一线倾情投入、奉献自我，用美好青春诠释了共产党人的初心使命，谱写了新时代的青春之歌。” <SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201910/2019102408470564.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201910/2019102408470568.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在校党委的倡议和带头学习下，各支部党员纷纷利用业余时间在“学习强国”平台认真学习了《黄文秀：用生命坚守初心使命的青年共产党员》的视频，深入了解青年党员黄文秀的先进事迹：她自觉践行党的宗旨，始终把群众的安危冷暖装在心间，带领群众发展多种产业，为村民脱贫致富倾注了全部心血和汗水。她心系群众、坚守初心的感人故事无不感动并鼓舞着我们党员。党员教师们纷纷表示要学习黄文秀同志敢于担当、百折不挠、咬定青山不放松的精神品质，忠诚于党的教育事业，立足教育岗位，勇立新功。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: 22.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt">支部书记上党课</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt">带头学习谈感悟</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">各支部集中开展的学习活动中，支部书记上党课是重头戏。本次支部书记上党课的筹备，校党委专门召开支部书记会议进行了集体备课与学习探讨，力求支部书记们把课上深、上实。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201910/2019102408473891.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在文科一支部，支部书记陈雪萍为党员们上了题为《不忘初心</SPAN><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">牢记使命——中国共产党党史中的一主线、四阶段、三个里程碑》的主题党课。她从党史中梳理了一条主线、四个阶段和三个里程碑，重点突出地展示了党带领人民群众在革命斗争、社会建设等不同时期的壮举和成就。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201910/2019102408475791.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在文科二支部，支部书记金华元讲授了<SPAN style="BACKGROUND: white">《中国共产党的光辉历程》的主题党课。他从中国共产党最初创立、发展过程以及重要历史事件三个方面进行梳理，特别突出了新民主主义革命时期七次会议的内容及意义。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="BACKGROUND: white" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="BACKGROUND: white" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201910/2019102408481444.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在理科一支部，支部书记陈锋则着重讲述了《重温中国共产党的创建》，简明扼要地回顾了中国共产党从无到有、从弱到强的最初筚路蓝缕、艰难创建的伟大过程。</SPAN><SPAN style="BACKGROUND: white" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="BACKGROUND: white" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201910/2019102408483147.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在理科二支部，支部书记陈连原以《讲奉献、有作为、敢担当》为题，联系党史党情，着重谈了新时代的党员“守初心”“担使命”应有的态度和行动。他强调，践行初心使命需要我们以直面困难的勇气、甘于奉献的意识、敢于担当的精神，在自己的教育工作岗位上奋发有为、积极善为。</SPAN><SPAN style="BACKGROUND: white" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="BACKGROUND: white" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201910/2019102408485111.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在学科竞赛支部，支部书记苏卫军以《重温党史、坚定信念、有所作为》为题，重温了建国以来我们党在发展历程中所经历的重要会议和重大事件，展现了党在建国以来的光辉历程，并以此来坚定全体党员爱党、爱国的信念。</SPAN><SPAN style="BACKGROUND: white" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="BACKGROUND: white" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201910/2019102408490776.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在行政支部，支部书记朱水军重点讲授了《重温建国以来党的若干重大会议》，历数了党在社会主义建设时期，特别是十一届三中全会以来党带领全国各族人民取得一个又一个伟大胜利的壮举，启发同志们更好地理解伟大新时代。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">鉴往知来，通过这些有温度的讲述，党员们对党史有了更深入地认识，对我们当下新时代新征程的使命有了更深刻的领悟，全体党员教师们纷纷表示以更加饱满的状态投入工作岗位，真正担使命、建新功。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: 22.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt">“应知应会”大测试</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt">走深走实学思悟</SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-INDENT: 22.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt"></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201910/2019102408492916.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><FONT size=3>党课结束后，各支部还严肃举行了主题教育“应知应会”大测试，引导全体党员教师以实际行动“比、学、赶、超”，更好地推进主题教育走深走实。各支部都以闭卷、限时的形式，组织了主题教育“应知应会”的《百问百答》试卷测评。党员们奋笔疾书，完成了一次对自我党性的检测和洗礼，交上了一份满意的答卷。通过此次党员“应知应会”大测试，各支部党员进一步了解和掌握了党的基本知识和理论，端正了学习态度，激发了学习的积极性和主动性，丰富了基层党组织的学习形式，也有助于提升学校基层组织力、推进党支部标准化建设。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
    
